{
  "description": "A Collie Client stores a book under a schema of each kind, Zod, ArkType, Valibot and a hand-written JSON Schema (ADR 0082): each `key_value_store.set` carries the schema's input form, the year as a string, and each `key_value_store.get` answers it, which the SDK parses into the output form. A stored value of an older shape, the year as a number, fails the typed read in the SDK; a value the schema rejects is never sent. The Run then finishes.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "hello",
        "params": {
          "protocol_version": "0.1",
          "surface": "sdk_typescript",
          "form": "typescript",
          "needs": "collie",
          "product_version": "0.0.0",
          "log_level": "off"
        }
      }
    },
